SUMMARY:Administrative Professionals Day
DESCRIPTION:Administrative Professionals Day falls in late April — April 
 22 in 2026 and April 21 in 2027\, the dates the International Association 
 of Administrative Professionals publishes. IAAP says on its own site that 
 the day was started by IAAP in 1952\, which makes it one of the few workpl
 ace observances still run by the body that created it. Its instruction to 
 anyone marking it is blunter than most: skip the flowers.\n\nhttps://today
 celebrates.com/holiday/administrative-professionals-day/
